OL,3,ABurnham announces plans to clean up
OL,4,Aworst three illegal waste dumps
OL,5,
OL,6,FFines for waste offences will also rise
OL,7,Ffrom #300 to #5,000 to deter, catch,
OL,8,Fand punish those who dump illegally,
OL,9,Fand the Environment Agency will have
OL,10,Fmore powers to seize assets bought with
OL,11,Fthe proceeds of crime by those
OL,12,Finvolved.
OL,14,FBut opposition parties said illegal
OL,15,Fdumps were a small part of a much
OL,16,Fbigger issue with smaller scale
OL,17,Ffly-tipping and landfill all posing big
OL,18,Fproblems for communities.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
